#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "68_Ajikawa"
msgid "Akiyama-san! I went to Kyushu No. 1 Star, as you suggested."
msgstr "¡Akiyama-san! Fui a Kyushu Estrella N° 1, como me sugeriste."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "80_Ajikawa"
msgid "The pork ramen was outstanding, and the topping accented the\\r\nsoup perfectly. It was the crown jewel of ramen shops!"
msgstr "El ramen de cerdo era extraordinario, los ingredientes combinaban con\\r\nla sopa perfectamente. ¡Fue la joya de la corona de los locales de ramen!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "92_Akiyama"
msgid "I'm glad you liked it."
msgstr "Me alegra que te haya gustado."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "104_Ajikawa"
msgid "I can't wait to include it in our gourmet guide. Here. It's\\r\nnot much, just a token of my thanks."
msgstr "No puedo esperar a incluirlo en nuestra, guía de gourmet. Toma,\\r\nno es mucho, pero es una pequeña muestra de mi agradecimiento."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "140_Ajikawa"
msgid "Akiyama-san! I just went to the ramen shop you suggested."
msgstr "¡Akiyama-san! Fui al local de ramen, como me sugeriste."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "152_Ajikawa"
msgid "They did indeed have some delicious ramen. It wasn't exactly\\r\nas you described, and the owner got a little upset when I\\r\ntalked to him."
msgstr "Sin duda, ellos hacían un ramen delicioso. Aunque no era exactamente\\r\ncomo me lo describiste, y el dueño se molestó un poco\\r\ncuando quise hablarle."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "164_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh? I hope I didn't get you in trouble."
msgstr "¿Eh? Espero no haberte metido en un aprieto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176_Ajikawa"
msgid "Oh, no, the place is definitely guidebook material, so I'm\\r\ngrateful. Here's a token of my thanks."
msgstr "Ah, no, el lugar tiene mucho material para una guía, así que estoy\\r\nagradecido. Toma una muestra de mi gratitud."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "212_Ajikawa"
msgid "Oh, Akiyama-san. I tried stopping by the ramen shop you\\r\nrecommended."
msgstr "Ah, Akiyama-san. Intente buscar el local de ramen\\r\nque recomendaste."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "224_Ajikawa"
msgid "I found what looked like the right place, but when I asked\\r\nabout the soup, the owner suddenly exploded with anger..."
msgstr "Encontré un lugar que parecía el correcto, pero cuando pregunte\\r\nsobre la sopa, el dueño de repente exploto de ira..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "236_Ajikawa"
msgid "I wonder if I said something wrong? The man chased me out\\r\ninto the street before I tried even one bite of my ramen..."
msgstr "Me pregunto si habré dicho algo malo. El hombre me echo a la calle\\r\nantes de que pudiese siquiera probar un poquito del ramen..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "248_Akiyama"
msgid "I guess I didn't really do my homework on that one. Sorry\\r\nabout that..."
msgstr "Supongo que fui descuidado y no hice mi tarea bien esta vez.\\r\nLo siento..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "260_Ajikawa"
msgid "Oh, I almost forgot... This is my thanks for your help."
msgstr "Ah, casi lo olvido... Esto es una muestra de mi agradecimiento."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "296_Ajikawa"
msgid "Anyway, Akiyama-san, I really want to thank you for all of\\r\nyour help."
msgstr "En fin, Akiyama-san, Realmente quiero agradecerte por\\r\ntoda tu ayuda."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "308_Akiyama"
msgid "I hope at least some of the info proves useful."
msgstr "Espero que la información te haya sido de utilidad."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "320_Ajikawa"
msgid "Yes, your tips got me well on my way to writing the\\r\ngourmet's guide to Kamurocho."
msgstr "Sí, tus consejos me llevarán por el buen camino para\\r\nescribir la guía gourmet de Kamurocho."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "344_Ajikawa"
msgid "In fact, as far as yakiniku and ramen go, I may just include\\r\nyour recommendations word for word."
msgstr "Incluso, en lo que se refiere al yakiniku y ramen, podría\\r\nescribir tus recomendaciones palabra por palabra."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "356_Ajikawa"
msgid "I'd like to thank you for all you've done. Please, take\\r\nthis."
msgstr "Me gustaría agradecerte todo lo que has hecho.\\r\nPor favor, acepta esto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "392_Akiyama"
msgid "But this is pretty valuable, isn't it? Now I feel bad."
msgstr "Pero esto es demasiado caro. Ahora me siento un poco mal."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "404_Ajikawa"
msgid "I'm off to sniff out more of Kamurocho's culinary gems!\\r\nFarewell!"
msgstr "¡Ahora me iré a olfatear unas cuantas joyas culinarias de\\r\nKamurocho más! ¡Adiós!"
